
---
import Button from "../../ui/Button.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20 w-full bg-base-200">
  <div class="mx-auto grid grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] max-w-3xl items-start gap-5 sm:gap-12">

    <img
      src="/media/authors/leandro.webp"
      alt="Leandro Ubilla"
      class="aspect-square w-full rounded-sm border-2 border-white object-cover"
    />

    <!-- About content -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-7">Hi, I'm Leandro</h2>

      <div class="space-y-2.5 text-md  text-base-content/70 sm:text-xl">
        <p>
          I design and build custom websites with Webflow and Astro
          for businesses that are ready to look as good online as
          they do in real life.
        </p>

        <p>
          After more than a decade designing and building for the web,
          I've learned that a good website needs to do more than look
          good. It needs to make your business clear, credible, and
          easy to choose.
        </p>

        <p>
          That's why I work across both design and development,
          taking projects from the first idea through to the final
          build. Whether it's built with Webflow or custom code,
          the goal is the same: a website that looks like your
          business belongs there.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <Button
          href="https://dribbble.com/leanug"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Find me on Dribbble
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
